  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey there everyone! As an artist that tends to create large maps, occasionally I may lose a person or two along the way when giving tours. The way it currently stands, the only way to easily meet back up with these people would be if everyone were to respawn. \n\nI think that especially for events, if you had the ability to send out a line of text or so to everyone currently in your world that would be very helpful. \n\n\"Gather at the spawn, meet at \"x\" landmark, we're heading to x location\" are a few examples of simple but effective messages that would help with keeping events orderly and making sure that everyone knows what is going on.\n\nThanks in advance, I love you guys, keep up the excellent work!\n\n-TheArchitect",
